IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. ROOT. PROCEDURE DIVISION. CALL 'MID'. STOP RUN. IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. MID. PROCEDURE DIVISION. DISPLAY 'MID'.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING 'MID' DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "MID"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [MID] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF. CALL 'LEAF'. EXIT PROGRAM. IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. LEAF. PROCEDURE DIVISION. DISPLAY 'LEAF'.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING 'LEAF' DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "LEAF"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [LEAF] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF. EXIT PROGRAM. END PROGRAM. END PROGRAM.

